@prefix chorus: <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# #4222 — AUTHORED route → domain and log-file → domain rows.
#
# These were 146 constants compiled into chorus-crawl. They are guesses, and a guess
# that only Kade can change, only by a build and a land, is not a model — it is a hack
# with a test around it. Jeff, 2026-09-19: "this feels like a hack". So they live here,
# beside the unit rows (#4084), where Wren and Silas correct them as data.
#
# OWNERSHIP: the rows are cross-role — routes and log files belong to the domains
# Wren and Silas own, and either of them edits this file directly. It sits under
# roles/kade/ontology/ only because #4222 was Kade's card; it belongs beside
# unit-domain-4084.ttl and should move there when either of them next touches it.
#
# A route or log file with no row here is UNPLACED and reported by name. There is no
# default and no fallback: an unmapped surface is a red, never a guess.

chorus:routedomain-root a chorus:UnitDomainMapping ;
    rdfs:label "/ → products" ;
    chorus:routePath "/" ;
    chorus:hasDomain chorus:products .

